OL,3,GNEWSAMore flights delayed after
OL,4,Ahundreds cancelled by air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol glitch
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlight delays will continue on
OL,8,FWednesday after an air traffic control
OL,9,Fproblem in the UK has led to more than
OL,10,F2,000 flights being cancelled.
OL,12,FTens of thousands of passengers have
OL,13,Fbeen hit with disruption which saw 291
OL,14,Fflights cancelled on Wednesday after
OL,15,F1,750 were axed on Tuesday, according
OL,16,Fto aviation analytics firm Cirium.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
