OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore flights delayed after
OL,4,Ahundreds cancelled by air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol glitch
OL,6,
OL,7,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,8,Fblamed a technical glitch and its boss
OL,9,FMartin Rolfe apologised, saying there
OL,10,Fwould be a full investigation after
OL,11,Fadmitting resolving the issue had taken
OL,12,F"longer than hoped".
OL,14,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband said the
OL,15,Foutage was "unacceptable" and Transport
OL,16,FSecretary Heidi Alexander has summoned
OL,17,FRolfe to a meeting to explain what
OL,18,Fhappened.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
